          "Text": "OOC: Stat-only rebuilds let you redistribute your starting stats and also refunds all AP used to upgrade them. In addition, your starting racial stat bonus will also be refunded.\n\nA Stat Refund Token is needed to purchase this rebuild. You may acquire one of these by purchasing a \"Reconditioning Tome\" found in special shops. \n\nStat-only rebuilds have a two-week cooldown (real world time).\n\n",
