      "JournalQuest": "",
      "Text": [
        {
          "Text": "OOC: Full character rebuilds let you refund all of your skills, stats and perks. Once refunded you will be allowed to freely redistribute your starting stats and skills. Use of this service will cost one Rebuild Token which are only granted by DMs. Do NOT ask DMs for these. If we deem it's necessary, one will be distributed to you.\n\nPlease be aware that once you choose to enter the rebuild area, the token will be taken from you even if you change your mind and opt not to rebuild your character. It's strongly recommended you do not use this token until you are absolutely ready - refunds won't be given!\n\nIf the server restarts while you are performing a rebuild, this token will NOT be refunded. Please be aware of this prior to performing a character rebuild.\n\nWhat would you like to do?",
